WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:17.245
Emmy was learning to knit.

2
00:00:17.246 --> 00:00:20.524
She had two knitting needles.

3
00:00:20.525 --> 00:00:24.718
She had lots of purple yarn.

4
00:00:24.719 --> 00:00:36.577
But Emmy didn't know what to make.

5
00:00:36.578 --> 00:00:42.156
"Brr," said Aunt Judy one morning.

6
00:00:42.157 --> 00:00:46.505
"It's almost winter."

7
00:00:46.506 --> 00:00:49.715
"I know what to make!" thought Emmy.

8
00:00:49.716 --> 00:00:53.964
"I'll make a warm scarf!"

9
00:00:53.965 --> 00:00:59.754
Emmy started knitting a purple scarf.

10
00:00:59.755 --> 00:01:02.630
The days got colder.

11
00:01:02.631 --> 00:01:08.171
Emmy kept knitting.

12
00:01:08.172 --> 00:01:14.516
"I'll need this scarf soon," she thought.

13
00:01:14.517 --> 00:01:28.011
Emmy worked fast.

14
00:01:28.012 --> 00:01:30.886
Soon the scarf was done.

15
00:01:30.887 --> 00:01:35.753
"This scarf will be so warm," thought Emmy.

16
00:01:35.754 --> 00:01:40.378
Emmy put on the scarf.

17
00:01:40.379 --> 00:01:43.970
"Oh no!" she moaned.

18
00:01:43.971 --> 00:01:48.754
"My scarf has lots of mistakes!"

19
00:01:48.755 --> 00:01:53.065
"Your scarf is still pretty," said Mom.

20
00:01:53.066 --> 00:01:57.175
"I like the purple yarn," said Dad.

21
00:01:57.176 --> 00:02:01.271
"Well, I don't," said Emmy.

22
00:02:01.272 --> 00:02:06.731
Emmy ran up to her room.

23
00:02:06.732 --> 00:02:11.923
She stuffed the scarf in a drawer.

24
00:02:11.924 --> 00:02:18.644
"I'm never knitting again," thought Emmy.

25
00:02:18.645 --> 00:02:22.545
One morning Oliver looked upset.

26
00:02:22.546 --> 00:02:25.948
His eyes filled with tears.

27
00:02:25.949 --> 00:02:29.743
"What's wrong, Oliver?" asked Emmy.

28
00:02:29.744 --> 00:02:34.243
"It's Purple Day at school," said Oliver.

29
00:02:34.244 --> 00:02:38.438
"But I don't have anything purple to wear."

30
00:02:38.439 --> 00:02:47.503
"Hmm . . ." Emmy ran to her room.

31
00:02:47.504 --> 00:02:50.722
"Here, Oliver," said Emmy.

32
00:02:50.723 --> 00:02:53.174
"You can wear my scarf."

33
00:02:53.175 --> 00:02:55.959
Oliver took Emmy's scarf.

34
00:02:55.960 --> 00:02:59.126
"It's purple!" cried Oliver.

35
00:02:59.127 --> 00:03:01.336
He put it on.

36
00:03:01.337 --> 00:03:10.664
Emmy smiled. "And it's perfect!"
